  "training": {
    "hints": [
      "Translate the lesson into explicit state and permissive logic: The transfer runs only with protection closed and both path sensors clear.",
      "Inputs are simulator feedback (guard_closed, entry_clear, exit_clear); PLC logic owns transfer_run, transfer_permissive.",
      "Test the initial state, the valid condition, and at least one missing permissive.",
      "The gate and curtain remain layout fixtures; guard_closed, entry_clear and exit_clear are manual test inputs, not safety-rated detection.",
      "transfer_run commands prescribed 0.45 m/s carton travel on the belt. transfer_complete retains at the supported exit; Reset reloads the infeed. Stop retains position. entry_carton_present and exit_carton_present report carton overlap with the installed optical routes; they are separate from manual path-clear fixtures.",
      "The explicit --audit-guarded-layout command writes .tools/plant-review-guarded-transfer.rpproj.json: a 20 ms ladder review reference that ANDs the three manual permissives and removes transfer_run at transfer_complete. Default lesson programs remain blank."
    ],
    "solution": {
      "summary": "This is an original functional reference for the control concept, not a copy of the photographed solution.",
      "steps": [
        "Require the documented inputs: guard_closed, entry_clear, exit_clear.",
        "Command the documented outputs: transfer_run, transfer_permissive.",
        "Remove PLC commands when the permissive is lost."
      ],
      "acceptance": "The transfer runs only with protection closed and both path sensors clear."
    },
    "assetRequirements": [
      "safety light-curtain pair",
      "guarded access gate",
      "safety relay/status beacon"
    ],
    "machineGuide": {
      "purpose": "A pallet transfer lane runs only while the access protection and clear-path inputs agree.",
      "startConditions": [
        "Load or create a compatible offline controller program; Run alone does not supply lesson logic.",
        "Set the manual guard_closed, entry_clear and exit_clear fixtures true to permit the review transfer."
      ],
      "normalSequence": [
        "PLC logic evaluates the three manual permissive inputs and owns transfer_permissive and transfer_run.",
        "The prescribed carton crosses the entry and exit optical routes, reporting separate PC occupancy feedback.",
        "At the supported exit, transfer_complete becomes true; the explicit review PLC removes transfer_run."
      ],
      "stopBehavior": [
        "The review PLC removes transfer_run when any manual permissive is withdrawn.",
        "Stop freezes scans and carton position. Run resumes the retained transfer when permissives agree.",
        "Reset restores the supported infeed carton, clears completion and resets manual fixtures."
      ],
      "faultBehavior": [
        "Manual fixture inputs and visual gate/curtain equipment do not establish safety-rated detection or physical interlocking."
      ],
      "expectedObservations": [
        "The carton remains supported and visible throughout travel and at completion.",
        "Only all three manual permissives allow the review PLC transfer; completed travel remains stopped until Reset."
      ]
    },
    "sequenceNumber": 26,
